{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And Judah also</b> — they are the rest of the people who remained; they will wage war in Jerusalem against the enemy to annihilate his remembrance. Then the people of Jerusalem will find gold and silver and garments gathered, and this is the meaning of \"I will gather all the nations against Jerusalem.\""], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:03.403563038Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}